#: ../userguides/pipelines.rst:1 ec63c9e96b64458ca519e15b66294555
msgid ""
"The core of the Mapflow are the Mapping Models. Mapflow enables to detect "
"and extract features in satellite and aerial images powered by semantic "
"segmentation and other deep learning techniques. See :ref:`requirements "
"<Model_requirements>` page to better understand what data to use with each "
"model, and :doc:`price list <prices>` for breakdown of the processings "
"billing."
msgstr ""
"Mapflow 的核心是映射模型。 Mapflow 能够检测和提取由语义分割和其他深度学习技术支持的卫星和航空图像中的特征。请参阅:ref:`要求 "
"<Model_requirements>` 页面，以更好地了解每个模型要使用哪些数据，并参阅:doc:`价目表 <prices>` "
"以了解处理计费的详细信息。"

#: ../userguides/pipelines.rst:6 b6eb89a9f1c94dd191857aa6c4e4a686
msgid ""
"For the data requirements – see :ref:`Model_requirements`. For the breakdown"
" of the Mapflow processings billing – see :doc:`Mapflow pricing <prices>`."
msgstr ""
"有关数据要求 - 请参阅模型要求。有关 Mapflow 处理计费的详细信息 – 请参阅:doc:`Mapflow 定价 <prices>`。"

