#: ../userguides/pipelines.rst:200 f17690a80f754ca08a98ffdf771500a6
msgid ""
"Detect forest, trees and shrub vegetation from 0.6-0.3 m satellite imagery. "
"Covers sparse forest, shrubland, small tree groups and narrow tree lines."
msgstr "从 0.6-0.3 m 卫星图像检测森林、树木和灌木植被。覆盖稀疏的森林、灌木丛、小乔木群和狭窄的林线。"

#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:5 e4dfb81c967b467b92a7ef9f01d0854f
msgid "🌲 Forest and trees"
msgstr "🌲 森林和树木"

#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:7 29c77c8a918f4e1d8c77aff3e7845614
msgid ""
"The model is trained on high-resolution data (0.6-0.3m) for different areas "
"and climate zones."
msgstr "该模型根据不同地区和气候带的高分辨率数据（0.6-0.3m）进行训练。"

#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:9 16b5a7f766344f0cb520fbb9fbeb359a
msgid ""
"The result includes all areas covered with tree and shrub vegetation, "
"including sparse forest and shrublands."
msgstr "结果包括所有树木和灌木植被覆盖的区域，包括稀疏的森林和灌木丛。"

#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:11 ee1e178868414c8dab751febad32f873
msgid ""
"Model resolution allows to detect small group of trees and narrow tree "
"lines."
msgstr "模型分辨率允许检测小群树木和狭窄的树线。"

#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:13 24415f6baecf47e09ab005dcdd91d2f6
msgid ""
"The model is robust to region change, and performs well in most "
"environments, including urban. The image should be taken in active "
"vegetation period, because leafless trees or vegetation covered with snow "
"are not the target class."
msgstr "该模型对区域变化具有鲁棒性，并且在包括城市在内的大多数环境中表现良好。图像应在植被活跃时期拍摄，因为无叶树木或被雪覆盖的植被不是目标类别。"

